text:
Samtang, indi man malikom ang pagsuporta sang mga pumuluyo sa pila ka mga lideres sa kalibutan nga mga babaye sa ila tumalagsahon nga liderato katulad nanday The Marshall Islands President Hilda Heine, New Zealand Prime Minister Jacinda Ardern, Namibia Prime Minister Saara Kuugongelwa-Amadhila;

Nepal President Bidhya Devi Bhandari, Estonia President Kersti Kaljulaid, Germany Chancellor Angela Merkel, Croatia President Kolinda Grabar-Kitarovic, Norway Prime Minister Erna Solberg,Taiwan President Tsai Ing-wen;

Ethiopia President Sahle-Work Zewde, Bangladesh Prime Minister Sheikh Hasina,

United Kingdom Prime Minister Theresa May, kag Lithuania President Dalia Grybauskaite.

english:
Meanwhile, the people's support for some women world leaders in their outstanding leadership such as The Marshall Islands President Hilda Heine, New Zealand Prime Minister Jacinda Ardern, Namibia Prime Minister Saara Kuugongelwa-Amadhila;

Nepal President Bidhya Devi Bhandari, Estonia President Kersti Kaljulaid, German Chancellor Angela Merkel, Croatia President Kolinda Grabar-Kitarovic, Norway Prime Minister Erna Solberg,Taiwan President Tsai Ing-wen;

Ethiopia President Sahle-Work Zewde, Bangladesh Prime Minister Sheikh Hasina,

United Kingdom Prime Minister Theresa May, and Lithuania President Dalia Grybauskaite.
